cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or the collection toolkit, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "LocalNet-Dynamics: A Longitudinal Local Area Network Telemetry Dataset"
authors:
  - family-names: "Aiersilan"
    given-names: "Aizierjiang"
version: 1.0.0
url: "https://github.com/Ezharjan/LocalNet-Dynamics"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Ezharjan/LocalNet-Dynamics"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  LocalNet-Dynamics is a longitudinal telemetry dataset of a residential/edge
  local area network, sampled every 30 seconds around the clock from a client
  machine. Each sample records ICMP latency, jitter and loss to a reference
  host and to the local gateway, TCP connect time, cached and recursive DNS
  response time, HTTP time-to-first-response, Wi-Fi link metrics and periodic
  WAN/LAN throughput tests. The consolidated dataset adds time-of-day features,
  gap information, rule-based reference labels and manual event annotations
  for forecasting, anomaly detection and quality-of-service research.
keywords:
  - network telemetry
  - latency
  - jitter
  - packet loss
  - DNS
  - Wi-Fi
  - throughput
  - quality of service
  - anomaly detection
  - time series
